WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
We need to mitigate the environmental impact of rapid urbanisation.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Policy makers face mounting pressure to ratify ambitious climate agreements.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.000
The issue remains contentious among delegates from emerging economies.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Without a coherent framework, disparities in funding will only widen.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Analysts caution that superficial reforms cannot substantiate long-term resilience.
